Third-party assets

Models, CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), re-oriented, scaled and re-exported for the game:
- "M249 Machine Gun [Game-ready Download]" by Oskar "K1TT3N" Adamczyk
  (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/m249-machine-gun-game-ready-download-631d0a61696a4703914d6b598b47505a), modified:
  scope replaced with the reflex sight below, carry handle folded, mesh reduced
- "Barrett M82 Baked/Textured" by Shariff Butler Jr.
  (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/barrett-m82-bakedtextured-416849efe5cb454a8e538188d5a300d1), modified:
  scope replaced with the reflex sight below
- "RG-6 Grenade Launcher" by Sassiska
  (https://sketchfab.com/3d-models/rg-6-grenade-launcher-d911c28d568c4dec838d67760f323d98), modified:
  leaf and front sights removed, the reflex sight below added
- "Artillery Shell" by SomeGuyUsingBlender
- "Low-Poly VOG-25 and VOG-25P" by notcplkerry
- "SciFi Cylinder Canisters" by Billy Jackman
- "Combat Turret" by Danila
- "Sci-fi Turret 3" by everlasting17th
- "Sci-Fi Turret" by JonasDelnaye

Reflex sight on the three heavy weapons, CC0 (https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/):
- "Red Dot Sight" by Jean PFP (https://opengameart.org/content/red-dot-sight), recoloured, red dot added

The stasis emitter is this mod's own model.

Effect textures:
- Kenney Particle Pack (CC0)
- Kenney Smoke Particles (CC0)
- "Smoke Aura" by Beast (CC0)
- Unity Labs free VFX image sequences (CC0)

Sounds, converted for the game:
- Sonniss GameAudioGDC bundles
- Boom Library
- freesound.org
- "Sci-fi Grenade Launcher" by ValhallaProject, CC BY 4.0 (https://freesound.org/people/ValhallaProject/sounds/771167/)
- "2 High Quality Explosions" by Michel Baradari, apollo-music.de, CC BY 3.0 (https://opengameart.org/content/2-high-quality-explosions)

Every clip and its source is listed in `Audio/License.txt`; every model and texture in `Models/License.txt`.
